          </h3>
          <p class="text-[#a1a1a6] text-[17px] leading-[1.47] tracking-[-0.022em] mb-6">
            Proxy outbound calls to external APIs. Relay handles timeouts, 429 rate limits, and 5xx retries transparently. Sync and async modes — no retry code in your application.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2.5" role="list">
            {[
              "Sync proxy: transparent forwarding with retry",
              "Async jobs: fire-and-forget, durable 202 Accepted",
              "Client abort-aware — cancels upstream on disconnect",
              "Idempotency key propagation",
            ].map((item) => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[14px] text-[#a1a1a6]">
                <i data-lucide="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-[#2997ff] mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i>
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </article>
      </div>

      <!-- Live Integration Snippet (Mental Model) -->
      <div class="mt-12 bg-[#2a2a2c] rounded-card p-6 md:p-8 border border-white/10">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between pb-4 border-b border-white/10 gap-2">
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-white font-semibold text-[16px] tracking-tight">How simple is integration?</h4>
            <p class="text-[#a1a1a6] text-[13px] mt-0.5">Two HTTP calls. That's the entire learning curve.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-mono text-[#2997ff] bg-[#2997ff]/10 self-start sm:self-auto">
            Standard HTTP REST
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mt-6 font-mono text-[12px]">
          <!-- Inbound Example -->
          <div class="bg-[#1d1d1f] rounded-[12px] p-4 border border-white/5 space-y-2">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[#6e6e73] text-[11px] pb-2 border-b border-white/5">
              <span>1. SEND INBOUND WEBHOOK</span>
              <span class="text-emerald-400">&larr; 200 OK (Instant ACK)</span>
            </div>
            <pre class="text-[#a1a1a6] overflow-x-auto leading-relaxed"><code><span class="text-white">curl -X POST</span> \
  http://localhost:8080/api/v1/webhook/stripe \
  -H <span class="text-[#2997ff]">"Stripe-Signature: t=123,v1=abc..."</span> \
  -d <span class="text-emerald-300">&#39;&#123;"event": "payment.succeeded"&#125;&#39;</span></code></pre>
            <p class="text-[#6e6e73] text-[11px] pt-1 border-t border-white/5">
              Verified &amp; committed to SQLite WAL before return. Delivered to internal app in background.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Outbound Example -->
          <div class="bg-[#1d1d1f] rounded-[12px] p-4 border border-white/5 space-y-2">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[#6e6e73] text-[11px] pb-2 border-b border-white/5">
              <span>2. RELAY OUTBOUND API CALL</span>
              <span class="text-emerald-400">&larr; Auto-Retry 429/5xx</span>
            </div>
            <pre class="text-[#a1a1a6] overflow-x-auto leading-relaxed"><code><span class="text-white">curl -X POST</span> \
  http://localhost:8080/api/v1/proxy/line-notify \
  -H <span class="text-[#2997ff]">"X-Relay-Max-Retries: 5"</span> \
  -H <span class="text-[#2997ff]">"Idempotency-Key: req_98234"</span> \
  -d <span class="text-emerald-300">&#39;&#123;"message": "Order #4092 shipped"&#125;&#39;</span></code></pre>
            <p class="text-[#6e6e73] text-[11px] pt-1 border-t border-white/5">
              Transparent proxy with exponential backoff and jitter. Aborts upstream if client drops.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
       SECTION 6 — SECURITY & OPEN SOURCE (Light tile)
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="w-full bg-canvas py-[80px] px-5" aria-labelledby="security-heading">
    <div class="max-w-[680px] mx-auto text-center">
      <!-- Shield icon -->
      <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-[#e8f0fb] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
        <i data-lucide="shield-check" class="w-8 h-8 text-primary"></i>
      </div>

      <h2 id="security-heading" class="text-[clamp(28px,5vw,40px)] font-semibold text-ink leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.022em] mb-5">
        Your data never leaves your server.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[#6e6e73] text-[17px] leading-[1.47] tracking-[-0.022em] mb-10 max-w-[520px] mx-auto">
        Simple Relay is fully self-hosted. Every payload, every retry log, every DLQ entry lives in <em>your</em> database on <em>your</em> infrastructure. Free and open source.
      </p>

      <!-- Trust badges -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mb-10">
        {[
          { icon: "server", label: "Self-hosted", desc: "Your infrastructure" },
          { icon: "package", label: "Open Source", desc: "Always free" },
          { icon: "eye-off", label: "No telemetry", desc: "Zero data collection" },
          { icon: "cpu", label: "CGO_ENABLED=0", desc: "Pure static binary" },
        ].map((badge) => (
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 px-5 py-4 bg-parchment rounded-card border border-divider min-w-[130px]">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-0.5">
              <i data-lucide={badge.icon} class="w-5 h-5"></i>
            </div>
            <span class="text-ink font-semibold text-[14px]">{badge.label}</span>
            <span class="text-[#6e6e73] text-[12px]">{badge.desc}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a
          href={GITHUB_URL}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-primary text-white text-[17px] font-normal px-[22px] py-[11px] rounded-pill hover:bg-[#0077ed] active:scale-95 transition-all duration-150"
        >
          View on GitHub
          <i data-lucide="external-link" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
       FOOTER (Parchment — dense link columns for SEO)
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <SiteFooter />

  <!-- Floating Sticky Action Pill (Apple-style sub-nav/floating bar) -->
  <aside
    id="floating-cta"
    class="fixed bottom-6 right-6 z-40 transition-all duration-300 opacity-0 translate-y-4 pointer-events-none"
    aria-label="Quick action bar"
  >
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 p-1.5 pl-3.5 bg-black/85 backdrop-blur-md rounded-full border border-white/15 shadow-product text-xs">
      <span class="text-white font-medium flex items-center gap-1.5">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
        Simple Relay
      </span>
      <a
        href={GITHUB_URL}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 bg-primary text-white font-medium px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full hover:bg-[#0077ed] active:scale-95 transition-all"
      >
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M10.226 17.284c-2.965-.36-5.054-2.493-5.054-5.256 0-1.123.404-2.336 1.078-3.144-.292-.741-.247-2.314.09-2.965.898-.112 2.111.36 2.83 1.01.853-.269 1.752-.404 2.853-.404 1.1 0 1.999.135 2.807.382.696-.629 1.932-1.1 2.83-.988.315.606.36 2.179.067 2.942.72.854 1.101 2 1.101 3.167 0 2.763-2.089 4.852-5.098 5.234.763.494 1.28 1.572 1.28 2.807v2.336c0 .674.561 1.056 1.235.786 4.066-1.55 7.255-5.615 7.255-10.646C23.5 6.188 18.334 1 11.978 1 5.62 1 .5 6.188.5 12.545c0 4.986 3.167 9.12 7.435 10.669.606.225 1.19-.18 1.19-.786V20.63a2.9 2.9 0 0 1-1.078.224c-1.483 0-2.359-.808-2.987-2.313-.247-.607-.517-.966-1.034-1.033-.27-.023-.359-.135-.359-.27 0-.27.45-.471.898-.471.652 0 1.213.404 1.797 1.235.45.651.921.943 1.483.943.561 0 .92-.202 1.437-.719.382-.381.674-.718.944-.943"/>
        </svg>
        <span>Star</span>
      </a>
      <a
        href="#quickstart-box"
        class="inline-flex items-center text-white/80 hover:text-white px-2 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-mono hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors"
      >
        Run
      </a>
    </div>
  </aside>

  <script is:inline>
    // Show floating bar after scrolling 400px past Hero
    window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
      const bar = document.getElementById('floating-cta');
      if (!bar) return;
      if (window.scrollY > 400) {
        bar.classList.remove('opacity-0', 'translate-y-4', 'pointer-events-none');
        bar.classList.add('opacity-100', 'translate-y-0', 'pointer-events-auto');
      } else {
        bar.classList.add('opacity-0', 'translate-y-4', 'pointer-events-none');
        bar.classList.remove('opacity-100', 'translate-y-0', 'pointer-events-auto');
      }
    });
  </script>
</Layout>
